# Three rooms in an L: a living room, a kitchen beside it and a study above, with a
# partition in the living room whose end is free. Nothing is pinned.
room living 5000 x 4000 at 0,0 walls 150
room kitchen 3000 x 4000 right of living walls 150
room study 5000 x 3000 above living walls 150
opening o1 1800 in living.east
door d1 900 in living.north
window w1 1500 in living.south centred
window w2 1200 in study.north
line partition from 2000,0 to 2000,2200
on partition.start living.south
